No baby dragon ever gives scales.  Any adult dragon has an equal
chance of givin scales on its first death and an equal but lower
chance any subsequent deaths.  In other words to be absolutely
certain of getting gray dragon scales without a wish you must kill
many gray dragons.

One of the things I like to collect is a spectrum of all 9 (?) colors
of dragon scales to carry up with me to the astal planes.  It takes
a very long time so a game with them is an overprepared game.



